flowchart LR
    H[Max host thread\nscene capture + revisions] --> S[Owned immutable snapshots]
    S --> Q[CPU old/new neighborhood query]
    Q --> C[Stable-ID compact active lists]
    C --> B{Measured route}
    B -->|small/unsupported| CPU[CPU fit + visible validation]
    B -->|large qualified work| GPU[GPU contact + guide fit]
    GPU --> R[Compact pose readback or supported shared buffer]
    CPU --> V[Independent final validation]
    R --> V
    V --> P[Private complete successor]
    P --> K{Revision + device generation still current?}
    K -->|no| D[Discard + retire after fences]
    K -->|yes| U[Host-thread atomic publication]
    U --> VP[Retained viewport\nshared source + pose]
    U --> RM[CPU canonical materialization\nrenderer / Bake / export]
    U --> LAST[Last complete result retained]
